testing: Merge objects (simple append)
元の形: objects/mergeWith の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import mergeWith from dw::core::Objects
output application/json
---
mergeWith({"a": 1, "b": 2}, {"c": 3, "d": 4})
%%% output application/json
{
  "a": 1,
  "b": 2,
  "c": 3,
  "d": 4
}
